: [831.630615234375, 1149.6871337890625], "widgets_values": ["A sleek and futuristic product poster for a robotic vacuum cleaner by KitFort. The central focus is the white circular robot vacuum with an elegant metallic rim; its top surface features a prominent \"AUTO\" power button centered within a minimalist control panel design — clean lines, subtle shadows indicating 3D depth, glossy finish reflecting ambient light.\n\nThe background employs dynamic gradient layers: deep royal blue dominates left to center (evoking technology & sophistication), transitioning into warm orange on right side (symbolizing energy/power). A bold horizontal platform in vibrant electric-blue supports the device at bottom-center, creating visual grounding while suggesting modernity and stability.\n\nTypography:\n- Main title “Робот Пылесос” rendered in ultra-bold sans-serif font (white) against dark navy backdrop – sharp edges, high contrast, slightly beveled effect enhancing tech feel.\n- Subtitle “с лазерной навигацией” appears below main headline inside a bright-orange rectangular banner with rounded corners—minimalist yet eye-catching accent color that pops from surrounding blues/oranges.\n- Key specs are arranged vertically along left edge using crisp white text over semi-transparent black/gray panels for readability:\n\n    • “5000па МОЩНОСТЬ ВСАСЫВАНИЯ” → large number emphasized, smaller descriptive phrase beneath it.\n    \n    • “3 режима работы” → simple icon + numeric callout styled like digital interface elements\n    \n    • Icon of water droplet labeled “Влажная уборка” under another translucent box\n\nRight-side vertical column highlights performance metrics in contrasting orange field:\n\n• Top icon resembles gear or settings symbol above “600 мл объем резервуара”\n\n• Below, same style icon depicts battery/speed indicator next to “180 мин работы без подзарядки”\n\nColor Palette Strategy:\nPrimary: Deep Blue (#0B2C7E), Electric Cyan Accent (#0094FF)\nSecondary Accents: Orange Gradient Band (#FDB813 -> #EA580C), White/Glossy Silver Device Body\nContrast Elements: High Contrast Black Panels behind technical data blocks ensure legibility without overwhelming visuals\n\nComposition Layout Follows Golden Ratio Principles:\nMain subject occupies roughly two-thirds width horizontally, positioned diagonally toward lower-right quadrant for balance and dynamism.\nText information flows logically around object: Left-hand info block provides functional details; Right-hand metric wall adds value-driven urgency.\nNegative space between textual sections enhances breathing room and prevents cluttered appearance.\n\nOverall Design Language:\nMinimalistic but impactful. Clean geometry meets advanced technological aesthetics. No unnecessary ornamentation — every element serves purpose. Lighting suggests studio photography quality with soft directional illumination highlighting curvature of machine body and reflective surfaces.\n\nFinal Output Prompt Translation Into English For AI Image Generation Tool:\n“Design a premium product advertisement poster featuring a modern white robotic vacuum cleaner named ‘KitFort’ set upon a glowing electric-blue pedestal. Use dramatic lighting effects casting realistic reflections across curved surfaces. Background gradients transition smoothly from intense midnight blue to fiery orange-red tones evoking innovation and endurance. Display key specifications prominently via modular floating boxes: powerful suction '5000Pa', laser navigation tagline, three working modes, wet cleaning feature iconography, plus operational stats including '600ml reservoir' and '180 minutes runtime'. Typography should utilize heavy-weight geometric sans-serifs for titles and clear icons paired with readable supporting fonts. Ensure all layout components follow balanced asymmetrical composition principles based on golden ratio theory. Apply highly polished, almost holographic finishes to appliance casing. Color scheme must include dominant cool-tones accented by energetic warmth — avoid any chaotic patterns or textures.”"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 118, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 73, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [115], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [292.51519775390625, 88], "pos": [841.177734375, 1055.7916259765625], "widgets_values": ["高饱和，艳丽的颜色，多余的文字，多余的logo"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 113, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 92, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "size": [626.821044921875, 934.517578125], "pos": [2026.1025390625, 594.0609741210938], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 20, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "flags": {}, "id": 18, "type": "PreviewImage", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewImage", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 20}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [117, 118], "label": "text", "type